  <jpigp_cor:NotesFinanceIncomeAndFinanceCostsConsolidatedFinancialStatementsIFRSTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration">&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;29．金融収益及び金融費用&lt;/p&gt;
